SUMMARY:Gong Sound Journey & Astrology Transmission
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\nAn immersive experience of Astrology & 
 Sound Alchemy.\n\n### ✨ **Star Sounds: A Sound Healing Journey with Davi
 d Heiss**\n\n**An immersive experience of Astrology & Sound Alchemy**\nEnt
 er the evening where **cosmic intelligence meets vibrational healing**.\nW
 e begin with a grounded yet intuitive transmission of the **current astrol
 ogical landscape**—translating what’s happening in the sky into real g
 uidance for navigating your life right now. Find out what Uranus (the Libe
 rator) Neptune (the divine doorway) Pluto (deep Desires) and Jupiter (Soci
 al Awarness) into Inner wisdom is being transmitted for your true calling 
 and place on earth and your future role in it.\nFrom there\, you’ll be g
 uided into a **deep\, multidimensional sound journey**.\nSurrounded by the
  resonance of **multiple gongs\, crystal and Tibetan bowls\, handpan\, and
  other harmonic instruments**\, your body becomes the receiver… and the 
 field begins to shift.\nThis is not just something you hear—\n**it’s s
 omething you feel\, something you enter.**\n\n### 🔊 **The Experience**\
 n\nAs the gong waves move through you:\n\n* The nervous system begins to *
 *downshift and unwind**\n* The mind softens\, releasing control\n* The bod
 y opens into **deep cellular resonance**\n* Stagnant energy begins to **mo
 ve\, release\, and reorganize**\n* This time we are fresh off a full moon 
 in Aquarius and the energies are still strong\n\nMany describe the experie
 nce as entering a **dreamlike\, timeless state**—\nwhere insight\, emoti
 on\, and clarity arise naturally from within.\nThe sound doesn’t guide y
 ou somewhere else…\n**it brings you deeper into yourself.**\n\n### 🌌 
 **Why This Now**\n\n2026 is not a passive year—it is revolutionary- an e
 volutionary leap is here now.\nWe are being asked to **trust ourselves at 
 a deeper level**\, to move without certainty\, and to listen inward more t
 han ever before.\nSound—especially the gong—has a unique ability to **
 bypass the thinking mind** and reconnect you with your own internal guidan
 ce system.\nThis journey is an opportunity to:\n\n* Reset your energetic f
 ield\n* Reconnect with your intuition\n* Realign with your inner rhythm\n*
  Sudden insight and clarity\n\n### 🌀 **What is Sound Healing?**\n\nSoun
 d healing works through **vibrational resonance**.\nThe rich\, non-linear 
 overtones of instruments like the gong interact directly with the body’s
  energetic and physical systems—supporting:\n\n* Relaxation and nervous 
 system regulation\n* Emotional release\n* Energetic clearing and activatio
 n\n* Expanded states of awareness\n\nYou don’t need to “do” anything
 —\nsimply **lie down\, receive\, and allow**.\n\nPrice is by Donation st
 arting at $22. Please give what you can.\nYou can Donate w credit card her
 e or at Vemno @Starsounds\nCash is okay at the door\, please let us know y
 ou coming...email [David@starsounds.love](mailto:David@starsounds.love)\n\
 nGet your tickets here: [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-de
 tails/gong-sound-journey-astrology-transmission)\n\n### 🧘 **What to Bri
 ng**\n\nYoga mat • Blanket • Pillow • Water • Anything for comfort
 \n\n**See You There**\n\n### 👤 **About David Heiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is 
 an **Evolutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding hims
 elf and others into deeper self-awareness through vibration and cosmic ins
 ight.\nSince 2012\, he has worked with the transformative power of **gongs
  and astrology**\, following a profound awakening that shifted his life to
 ward a path of healing and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astro
 logical intelligence** (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immer
 sion** (direct vibrational experience)\n\nCreating a space where participa
 nts can **remember who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is sim
 ple and precise: to help you **experience yourself more fully**.
