SUMMARY:✨ Gong Sound Immersion in the Dome ✨with David Heiss✨
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n**Star Sounds with David Heiss**\n**Spe
 cializing in Astrological Events and Sound Healing Journeys**\n\nStep into
  the energy of Mars and Venus with Sound and deep restoration\, reflection
 \, and vibrational alignment at the beautiful Light Center in Black Mounta
 in\, NC.\n\nRegister Here $30 [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/ev
 ent-details/gong-sound-immersion-in-the-dome-with-david-heiss)\n\n### Gong
  Sound Journey with David Heiss\n\nAs we move through the heart of Leo Sea
 son w **Lions Gate** approaching\, Mars in Gemini forms a dynamic square t
 o Venus in Virgo\, creating a tension between the mind and the heart\, cur
 iosity and commitment\, movement and meaning.\nMars in Gemini can scatter 
 our energy in many directions\, while Venus in Virgo seeks clarity\, refin
 ement\, and purpose. Together they invite us to examine where we may be ov
 erthinking\, over analyzing\, or divided between what we desire and what t
 ruly nourishes us.\nThis immersive gong sound journey offers an opportunit
 y to step beyond mental noise and reconnect with a deeper inner rhythm. Th
 e rich vibrations of gongs\, singing bowls\, and sacred sound create space
  for relaxation\, insight\, and nervous system restoration.\nJoin David He
 iss for an evening of sound\, stillness\, and renewal as we explore the ba
 lance between thought and feeling\, action and wisdom\, under the radiant 
 fire of Leo Season.\n**Come as you are. Leave a little lighter.**\n\nThis 
 special gathering invites you into a meditative sound journey designed to 
 calm the nervous system\, quiet the noise of the outer world\, and awaken 
 clarity within.\n\nThrough the immersive tones of gongs\, singing bowls\, 
 and healing frequencies\, we will create space to release mental overload\
 , reconnect with intuition\, and align with the changing energies of this 
 pivotal time.\nHeld in the peaceful mountain energy of the Light Center\, 
 this experience is both grounding and expansive... an invitation to slow d
 own\, breathe deeply\, and listen inward.\nCome as you are. **Bring a yoga
  mat\, blanket\, pillow\, water\, and anything needed to remain comfortabl
 e while lying down during the sound immersion.**\n\n**The evening will beg
 in with a brief astrology transmission exploring the deeper meaning of Ven
 us and Mars**\, illuminating the dance between desire and discernment\, mo
 vement and meaning\, heart and mind. We will then journey into an immersiv
 e gong sound healing **In the Dome** featuring several gongs\, crystal and
  Tibetan bowls\, and other deeply resonant instruments designed to calm th
 e mind\, awaken the spirit\, and realign the nervous system with the rhyth
 ms of nature and cosmos.\n\n**This will be an afternoon of stillness\, won
 der\, activation\, and connection beneath the living sky with Sound.**\nCo
 me ready to listen\n\nCome ready to receive\n\nCome ready to remember\n\n#
 ## 👤 **About David Heiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astrolog
 er and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding others into deeper self-awaren
 ess through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has worked with
  the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**\, following a profoun
 d awakening that shifted his life toward a path of healing and inner disco
 very.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (understanding 
 your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibrational experience)
 \n\nCreating a space where participants can **remember who they are on a d
 eeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to help you **experie
 nce yourself more fully**.\nSign up here: $30 [Star Sounds](https://www.st
 arsounds.love/event-details/gong-sound-immersion-in-the-dome-with-david-he
 iss)\n**Tickets: $30 in advance\; day of event $35**
