SUMMARY:✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong Meditation✨
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n## 🎶✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & 
 Gong Meditation✨🎶\n\n**Sunday August 2nd 2:00-3:30 PM at Quietude San
 ctuary\, Black Mountain**\n\nJoin astrologer and sound practitioner **Davi
 d Heiss of Star Sounds** for a nourishing Sunday afternoon designed to hel
 p you align with the rhythms of the cosmos while settling deeply into stil
 lness\, presence\, and restoration.\nEach gathering begins with a **20-min
 ute Astrology Transmission**\, exploring the current planetary transits an
 d the deeper themes moving through the collective and our personal lives. 
 Through an evolutionary and soul-centered lens\, David offers practical an
 d inspiring insights to help you consciously navigate the energies of the 
 week ahead.\nFrom there\, participants will be guided into a **50-minute G
 ong Sound Journey**. Surrounded by the resonant tones of planetary gongs\,
  singing bowls\, and sacred sound instruments\, you'll be invited into a m
 editative state where the thinking mind can soften\, the nervous system ca
 n unwind\, and a deeper connection to Self can emerge.\nWhether you are se
 eking relaxation\, spiritual insight\, emotional renewal\, or simply a qui
 et place to rest and reconnect\, this weekly experience offers a sacred pa
 use from the busyness of everyday life.\n\n**🙏Donations Start at $33-Pl
 ease give more if you can. If $33 is to much\, just email David at [david@
 starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) for a special price🙏**\n
 \n### 👤 **About David Heiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astro
 loger and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding himself and others into dee
 per self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he 
 has worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**\, foll
 owing a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path of healing 
 and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** 
 (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibratio
 nal experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **remember who 
 they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to hel
 p you **experience yourself more fully**.\n\n**Register here:** [Star Soun
 ds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/cosmic-quietude-astrology-go
 ng-meditation)\n\n**🧘‍♂️Please bring your own "sound healing nest
 "** including blankets\, pillows\, bolsters\, or any other comforts that w
 ill support you in resting deeply during the journey. **Yoga mats are prov
 ided by Quietude.**\nCome settle into stillness\, attune to the wisdom of 
 the heavens\, and allow the medicine of sound to carry you home to yoursel
 f.\n*"As above\, so within."*
